      {
        "id": 2111057589,
        "node_id": "PR_kwDOLBN4sM591C61",
        "number": 33,
        "state": "closed",
        "title": "Fix: Handle None Namespace Case Properly",
        "body": "Currently, the below snippet upserts a vector to namespace `None`. We're now handling it to upsert to the default namespace.\r\n\r\n```python\r\nindex = Index.from_env()\r\n\r\nvec = [1] * 1536\r\n\r\nres = index.upsert(vectors=[{\"id\": \"1\", \"vector\": vec}], namespace=None)\r\n```",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/upstash/vector-py/pull/33",
        "created_at": "2024-10-07T14:48:03Z",
        "updated_at": "2025-01-07T09:03:17Z",
        "closed_at": "2024-10-11T07:40:23Z",
        "merged_at": "2024-10-11T07:40:23Z",
        "merge_commit_sha": "4bb79dfb22b221160aa12ecfa709ea9964dc7058",
        "draft": false,
