      {
        "id": 1710273712,
        "node_id": "PR_kwDOLBN4sM5l8LSw",
        "number": 15,
        "state": "closed",
        "title": "Fix httpx dependency version to be compatible with langchain",
        "body": "```\r\n> poetry add upstash_vector --optional\r\nUsing version ^0.2.0 for upstash-vector\r\n\r\nUpdating dependencies\r\nResolving dependencies... (0.2s)\r\n\r\nBecause upstash-vector (0.2.0) depends on httpx (>=0.25.0,<0.26.0)\r\n and no versions of upstash-vector match >0.2.0,<0.3.0, upstash-vector (>=0.2.0,<0.3.0) requires httpx (>=0.25.0,<0.26.0).\r\nSo, because langchain-community depends on both httpx (^0.24.1) and upstash-vector (^0.2.0), version solving failed.\r\n```",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/upstash/vector-py/pull/15",
        "created_at": "2024-02-04T08:55:52Z",
        "updated_at": "2024-04-15T20:37:30Z",
